        "TileImage": "$($repository 8b29da09-461f-44d7-9042-d4fde829b9f2).Image",
        "Description": "47 listen. This is Agent Smith.\r\rI know you said I shouldn&apos;t be contacting you but this is too important. \rHelmut Kruger is not the guy you should&apos;ve killed because he&apos;s not a real mastermind. In fact he&apos;s not involved at all. \r\rBut that&apos;s not why I&apos;m here. I know you&apos;re on your way to the nightclub in Berlin. Watch out 47, there&apos;re sending assassins to kill you.\r\rRolf is the guy leading the operation. \r\rI&apos;ll let you know if I find out anything about the real mastermind.\r\rWatch yourself 47.",
